                            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>•</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold'> The monthly score stayed between 45 and 49, with no clear trend.</run>
                            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>•</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold'> A good score can hide weak metrics: python-bigquery scores 64.3 but has a 876 h response time and 78.5% of issues unanswered.</run>
