                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>Key insights</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>•</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold'>16 of 30 repositories are At Risk or Critical.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>•</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold'> Core is the weakest ecosystem: both repositories are Critical (average 35.2).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>•</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold'> The monthly score stayed between 45 and 49, with no clear trend.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>•</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold'> A good score can hide weak metrics: python-bigquery scores 64.3 but has a 876 h response time and 78.5% of issues unanswered.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Written 3 Oct 2026.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
