                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>1. Measure -</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'> Six raw metrics per repository: bus factor, active maintainers, response time, unanswered share, bug backlog, retention.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
