                <zone fixed-size='144' forceUpdate='true' h='17253' id='69' type-v2='text' w='23498' x='475' y='81834'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Sensitivity</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>. Rankings hold up across three preset weightings (correlation 0.60 to 0.88), but tier labels don&apos;t: only 9 of 30 repositories (30%) keep the same quartile under all three. Dask, snowflake-connector-python and great_expectations are bottom-tier under every weighting.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Computed 11 Oct 2026.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='10' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8517' id='70' type-v2='text' w='42657' x='23973' y='90575'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>What this doesn&apos;t tell you     </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'> Scores are ranks within these 30 repositories, not absolute quality.    </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'> Missing response data scores a neutral 0.5.    </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'> Archived repositories are still scored (python-bigquery).    </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8'>•</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'> Weights are judgement calls. The dropdown shows their effect.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
